{
  "_comment": "Pi Box container seccomp profile v1 (SPEC.md §14.7.5, PROP-008). Deny-list: default-allow with dangerous kernel-surface syscalls blocked. Versioned; passed explicitly to every OCI engine via --security-opt seccomp=.",
